     "metadata": {}
    },
    "create_time": 1762980748.0,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "urgent. live deployment rn in cs3114 lab. section B clients are reconnecting every ~40s and we're losing events. frontend log:\n\n```\n[vizpi-ws] socket closed code=1006 reason=\n[vizpi-ws] reconnecting in 1000ms (attempt 1)\n[vizpi-ws] connected sid=Qm7f...\n[vizpi-ws] flush: 0 queued events\n[vizpi-ws] socket closed code=1006 reason=\n```\n\nevents between close and reconnect never show up in the db. section A is fine. same code"
     ]
    },
    "status": "finished_successfully",
    "end_turn": null,
    "weight": 1.0,
