    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "we use socket.io. client is socket.io-client 4.7. heres the emit wrapper\n\n```ts\nexport function track(evt: TelemetryEvent) {\n  if (!socket.connected) return;\n  socket.emit(\"telemetry\", evt);\n}\n```"
     ]
