    "create_time": 1762981015.347,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Yes, if the frontend is a static build behind the same server:\n\n1. Rebuild only the client: `npm run build` in `vizpi_frontend`.\n2. Copy/replace the static bundle (hashed filenames mean old tabs keep the old bundle until reload).\n3. Ask section B students to **refresh the tab** (TAs can announce it). Only refreshed tabs get the fix.\n\nDon't restart the socket server mid-lab. That forces every client in both sections to reconnect at once.\n\nLeave the server `pingInterval` change for after lab unless you can restart in under a few seconds with the TAs warned."
     ]
    },
