    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Don't drop them silently. Mark them:\n\n- Add a `possibly_incomplete` flag to any 30 s window that overlaps a disconnect gap.\n- Label them anyway, but exclude them from the main analysis and report the exclusion count. Or run the analysis both ways as a robustness check.\n\nDropping only section B's bad windows could also bias your sample if section B differs (different TA, time of day). Report it in the deployment notes either way."
